WEBVTT

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:19.530
Fly, fly, fly over the ladder.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:23.730
The gentle white butterfly.

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:26.730
The cowardly caterpillar.

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:29.890
We're all friends.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:53.590
"I'm sure my friends will be happy."

00:01:30.570 --> 00:01:46.000
The children, even if you are alone, live and build a new country of the Tzu-me-batch.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:02:00.000
The Tzu-me-batches were attacked by the Tzu-me-batches, and the Tzu-me-batches were killed by the Tzu-me-batches.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:06.400
They fought with blood, but were killed by the sharp spear of the cruel hornet.

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:15.370
When will peace return to this land of honeybees?

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:19.320
They were saddened by the poor land of honeybees, and the cold rain continued to fall.

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:55.990
It's okay. I'm sorry. I'm sorry. I'm sorry. I'm sorry. You're a child. I'm sorry.

00:03:06.810 --> 00:03:09.410
Today is the day when the children return from the eggs.

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:14.170
Make a delicious bread with plenty of honey.

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:17.850
Come on, my children, please get up well.

00:03:17.850 --> 00:03:22.630
Come on, hurry up!

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:26.470
Well, the healthy children.

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:31.800
What a nice girl.

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:33.180
You should get along with her.

00:03:33.180 --> 00:03:35.320
I'm hungry, too.

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:37.980
There are a lot of delicious breads here.

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:39.980
Come on, let's go to the table.

00:03:39.980 --> 00:03:51.310
Three people...

00:03:51.310 --> 00:03:52.970
Oh, one isn't enough.

00:03:53.970 --> 00:03:56.410
That's right, that's the one.

00:03:57.460 --> 00:04:00.000
Sleepy, hurry up and wake up.

00:04:01.150 --> 00:04:09.620
I'll be waiting for you.

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:19.980
Have a nice day.

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:28.550
That's not it.

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:29.320
Good morning.

00:04:31.400 --> 00:04:37.150
You're cute. Your name is so cute, isn't it?

00:04:37.150 --> 00:04:38.680
Hatch is good, isn't it?

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:40.490
He's so small.

00:04:40.490 --> 00:04:42.170
And he's fat.

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:45.650
He's so chubby, even though he's from Shimakohanagachi.

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:48.770
He's just a baby, so it can't be helped.

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:50.570
Now, get on the table.

00:04:50.570 --> 00:04:53.840
I'll bring you some bread.

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:08.590
Suekko, sit on the edge of the table!

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:17.510
Thank you for waiting.

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:21.040
Suekko, sit on the back!

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:24.480
You can't fight like that.

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:27.210
Are you my child?

00:05:27.210 --> 00:05:28.450
What?

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:31.210
It doesn't look like you at all.

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:34.920
Is this really my baby?

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:37.420
Don't be silly.

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:39.160
Hachi is my baby.

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:42.040
Eat well.

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:49.110
Get well soon.

00:05:49.110 --> 00:05:52.560
Eat a lot.

00:05:52.560 --> 00:05:55.090
Eat a lot and grow up.

00:06:01.050 --> 00:06:05.050
Hatch seems to like it, but he's my child.

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:09.050
I'm sure I'll raise him up to be a strong child who won't lose to anyone.

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:20.580
I'm playing. I'm going out for a while.

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:22.530
Can't you go outside?

00:06:22.530 --> 00:06:26.460
I can't. There are a lot of scary things outside.

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:30.000
You can't go out until I say it's okay. Got it?

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:38.320
I wonder if there's anything interesting going on here.

00:06:38.320 --> 00:06:42.040
We can't do anything in such a small house.

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:44.330
I wonder what kind of place it is outside.

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:46.620
I told you not to go outside.

00:06:46.620 --> 00:06:49.140
This place is really scary.

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:31.060
I won't do it!

00:07:31.060 --> 00:07:33.060
Hachi, don't tell Mama about this!

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:36.060
Fine! It's your responsibility if this happens!

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:37.880
Follow me, come on!

00:07:37.880 --> 00:07:38.880
Come on!

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:42.100
You're so mean! I'm not good at anything!

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:16.420
*laughs*

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:19.170
*laughs*

00:10:19.170 --> 00:10:27.630
*crickets*

00:10:27.630 --> 00:10:30.000
*crickets*

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:20.720
You're getting in my way, kid!

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:27.680
You're so mean!

00:11:31.020 --> 00:11:32.150
Hmm.

00:12:00.160 --> 00:12:07.680
The arrow.

00:13:01.180 --> 00:13:08.120
I told you not to go out in the middle of the night.

00:13:11.190 --> 00:13:14.410
You're hiding something from me, aren't you?

00:13:14.410 --> 00:13:16.650
Mom, that's...

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:19.820
I just got separated from Hachi in the middle of the night.

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:24.880
Poor thing. Who the hell did you say you were going to go out with?

00:13:24.880 --> 00:13:26.930
It's Hachi, isn't it, everyone?

00:13:26.930 --> 00:13:28.850
Why me?

00:13:28.850 --> 00:13:30.000
It's Hachi.

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:36.530
Hatch betrayed me.

00:13:36.530 --> 00:13:39.090
That Hatch is such an ungrateful child.

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:41.710
I have to scold him when he comes home.

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:44.460
Mama!

00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:45.910
Hatch!

00:13:45.910 --> 00:13:59.190
It's okay, Hatch.

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:02.180
I'm safe now, right?

00:14:02.180 --> 00:14:04.180
You're not going to scold me, are you?

00:14:04.180 --> 00:14:15.860
You're so sweet.

00:14:15.860 --> 00:14:21.740
Let's go and see Mr. Oshima's face.

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:24.940
Mr. Oshima!

00:14:24.940 --> 00:14:27.210
You're still so energetic.

00:14:27.210 --> 00:14:29.210
I'm not energetic at all.

00:14:30.440 --> 00:14:33.080
I'm still young, you know.

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:35.200
I'm still young, you know.

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:39.510
Naro, you talk a lot, don't you?

00:14:39.510 --> 00:14:42.100
I do. I'm Ab's auntie Pechakucha.

00:14:42.100 --> 00:14:43.640
Pechakucha's auntie?

00:14:43.640 --> 00:14:45.360
That's strange.

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:47.330
Hello, everyone. I'm Ab's auntie.

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:48.410
Please say hello.

00:14:48.410 --> 00:14:49.720
Yes, yes.

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:51.620
Hello.

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:55.060
Yes, yes. You're all fine and healthy.

00:14:55.060 --> 00:14:59.730
You're so happy to have so many children.

00:15:00.440 --> 00:15:03.900
Besides, I'm one of the best students in the world.

00:15:03.900 --> 00:15:07.280
When I was little, I was so old that I couldn't even fly.

00:15:07.280 --> 00:15:09.940
I couldn't raise my kids at all.

00:15:09.940 --> 00:15:12.200
I really don't like it anymore.

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:13.500
Thank you for the food.

00:15:13.500 --> 00:15:14.930
Here's some water for you.

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:17.540
Hachi, drink it yourself.

00:15:17.540 --> 00:15:18.600
Okay.

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:26.920
That's the stego you picked up.

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:27.650
What?

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:36.420
You know, I suddenly remembered something.

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:37.700
Oh, I see.

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:43.790
Then let's go there together.

00:15:48.450 --> 00:15:52.660
Huh? What's wrong with everyone?

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:56.720
Hmm.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.340
She's a poor girl.

00:16:01.340 --> 00:16:03.600
I'm raising her thinking that she's my child.

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:05.100
That's impossible.

00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:05.680
What?

00:16:05.680 --> 00:16:09.220
A honey bee can't be raised unless it's a honey bee.

00:16:09.220 --> 00:16:11.720
Honey bees are very aggressive.

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:16.330
They can't be raised with a flower bee's child.

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:24.050
I'm a stegosaurus.

00:16:24.050 --> 00:16:26.130
That's what I heard.

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:26.590
Huh?

00:16:26.590 --> 00:16:29.510
I can't believe what you're saying.

00:16:30.190 --> 00:16:31.640
That's what I said, Hachi.

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:56.880
I thought you were a real child.

00:18:04.480 --> 00:18:23.680
You are a brave and strong honey bee.

00:18:23.680 --> 00:18:26.080
That's right.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:34.610
In the land of brave honeybees, a terrible hornet attacked them one day.

00:18:35.290 --> 00:18:39.980
The brave honeybees fought until the end, but they finally lost.

00:18:40.780 --> 00:18:43.770
The queen drank her tears and ran away.

00:18:44.340 --> 00:18:48.340
She prayed that someone would survive and rebuild the land of honeybees.

00:18:55.730 --> 00:18:58.760
You are one of the saved honeybees.

00:18:58.760 --> 00:18:59.670
Be strong.

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:02.370
You're the brave little honey bee, aren't you?

00:19:10.310 --> 00:19:30.000
I'll make sure you grow up well.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:42.710
I'll show you what I've got.

00:20:01.790 --> 00:20:08.680
They're all kind and easy-going.

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:12.310
But then they say, "throw it away, throw it away."

00:20:12.310 --> 00:20:25.030
Call me Mama.

00:20:44.780 --> 00:20:47.140
Don't go anywhere and send me away.

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:49.640
I really want to see my mother!

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:51.640
My friends were killed by the hornets.

00:20:51.640 --> 00:20:54.010
But my real mother must be alive.

00:20:54.010 --> 00:20:56.010
If I think about it, I really want to see her.

00:20:56.010 --> 00:20:59.540
You are still a child.

00:21:00.510 --> 00:21:05.330
This world is vast, and there are many horrible and sad things.

00:21:05.330 --> 00:21:07.630
But I'm not going to lose to anything.

00:21:07.630 --> 00:21:09.440
No, I can't lose.

00:21:09.440 --> 00:21:14.720
Somewhere, I can hear the voice of the bees' friends calling me.

00:21:14.720 --> 00:21:22.340
Hatchi, the honeybee's blood is awakening in this child's heart.

00:21:22.340 --> 00:21:28.520
Oyuki.

00:21:47.470 --> 00:21:49.900
You're Mitsubachi's child, aren't you?

00:21:49.900 --> 00:21:55.240
You can't lose to anything.

00:21:55.240 --> 00:21:58.080
You're going to meet your real mother.

00:21:58.080 --> 00:21:59.600
Take care, Oyuki.

00:22:24.380 --> 00:22:25.890
I'm not

00:22:32.140 --> 00:22:34.610
Hachi, I'm sorry.
